ultBody";}s:31:"caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText";a:1:{i:0;s:117:"The team shipped a complex integration on a tight timeline without sacrificing quality. We would work with NSC again.";}s:32:"_caseStudyComponents_2_quoteText";a:1:{i:0;s:73:"field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_quoteText";}s:30:"caseStudyComponents_2_citeName";a:1:{i:0;s:10:"Priya Shah";}s:31:"_caseStudyComponents_2_citeName";a:1:{i:0;s:72:"field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_citeName";}s:30:"caseStudyComponents_2_citeRole";a:1:{i:0;s:14:"CTO / HelioPay";}s:31:"_caseStudyComponents_2_citeRole";a:1:{i:0;s:72:"field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyQuote_citeRole";}s:42:"caseStudyComponents_3_collaborationHeading";a:1:{i:0;s:22:"Collaboration overview";}s:43:"_caseStudyComponents_3_collaborationHeading";a:1:{i:0;s:83:"field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_collaborationHeading";}s:49:"caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_0_blockTitle";a:1:{i:0;s:16:"Engagement model";}s:50:"_caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_0_blockTitle";a:1:{i:0;s:88:"field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_overviewBlocks_blockTitle";}s:49:"caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_0_blockLines";a:1:{i:0;s:215:"<p>Embedded squads with shared rituals and a single backlog.</p><p>Architecture spikes early to de-risk the highest-unknown integrations.</p><p>Quarterly planning that balances maintenance with new capabilities.</p>";}s:50:"_caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_0_blockLines";a:1:{i:0;s:88:"field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_overviewBlocks_blockLines";}s:49:"caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_1_blockTitle";a:1:{i:0;s:14:"Data & quality";}s:50:"_caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_1_blockTitle";a:1:{i:0;s:88:"field_caseStudyComponents_caseStudyComponents_nscCaseStudyMain_overviewBlocks_blockTitle";}s:49:"caseStudyComponents_3_overviewBlocks_1_blockLines";a:1:{i:0;s:224:"<p>Automated